198 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 706 0 R
/ActualText (In React, rendering lists is a common operation when you're working with dynamic data \(refer to Day 11 of this series to learn how lists and keys work in React\). While this might seem straightforward, there are important performance considerations you must take into account to ensure your React app runs efficiently.)
/Pg 9 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
