<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/T (One of the key techniques for optimizing list rendering in React is the proper use of keys. )
/E (One of the key techniques for optimizing list rendering in React is the proper use of keys. )
/Pg 9 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
