201 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/T (Whenever you render a list of elements, React needs a way to keep track of which items have changed, been added, or removed from the list. This is where keys come into play.)
/E (Whenever you render a list of elements, React needs a way to keep track of which items have changed, been added, or removed from the list. This is where keys come into play.)
/Pg 9 0 R
/K [5]
>>
